  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Varities of Democracy 2022-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Varieties of Democracy (V-Dem) provides a multidimensional and disaggregated dataset for indicators relating to the concept of democracy as a system of rule, covering not only democracy but also wide aspects of development. The V-Dem project distinguishes between five high-level principles of democracy: electoral, liberal, participatory, deliberative, and egalitarian, and collects data to measure these principles. The research emanating from the data-base, focusing on how the broad set of V-Dem indicators interrelates, has among other findings distinguished the relevance of accountability mechanisms for social, economic and environmental development. The data-base has proven to be an efficient support to development cooperation agencies in defining key areas and sequencing of activities for achieving a maximized support for development including the combat of poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
